{"abstract":[{"text":"The Drop-in handles the presentation of available payment methods and the subsequent entry of a customer’s payment details. It is initialized with the payment methods of the ","type":"text"},{"code":"\/sessions","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" response, and handles the entire checkout flow under the hood for most of use cases."}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","title":"DropIn","modules":[{"name":"Adyen"}],"role":"article"},"kind":"article","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the simplified checkout flow with the "},{"code":"\/sessions","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" endpoint does not work for you, or you prefer to have more control over the whole flow, please refer to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"AdvancedFlow.md","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"text":"Setting up the Drop-in","anchor":"Setting-up-the-Drop-in","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All Components need an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenContext","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". An instance of ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenContext"},{"type":"text","text":" wraps your client key, environment, payment, analytics configuration and so on."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Please read more ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/docs.adyen.com\/development-resources\/client-side-authentication","isActive":true},{"text":" about the client key and how to get one.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Environment.test"},{"text":" during testing. Wh