Code: \"USD\",","                                       summaryItems: summaryItems)","","let dropInConfiguration = DropInComponent.Configuration()","dropInConfiguration.applePay = .init(payment: applePayment,","                               merchantIdentifier: \"merchant.com.adyen.MY_MERCHANT_ID\")"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Also for voucher payment methods like Doku variants, in order for the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/DokuComponent","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to enable the shopper to save the voucher, access to the shopper photos is requested, so a suitable text needs to be added to the "},{"code":"NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" key in the application ","type":"text"},{"code":"Info.plist","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Presenting-the-Drop-in","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Presenting the Drop-in"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Initialize the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/DropInComponent","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" class and set the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenSession","isActive":true},{"text":" instance as the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"delegate"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"partialPaymentDelegate"},{"type":"text","text":" (if needed) of the "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/DropInComponent","type":"reference"},{"text":" instance.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let dropInComponent = DropInComponent(paymentMethods: paymentMethods,","                                      context: context,","                                      configuration: dropInConfiguration)"," ","\/\/ Keep the Drop-in instance to avoid it being destroyed after the function is executed.","self.dropInComponent = dropInComponent"," ","\/\/ Set session as the delegate for Drop-in","dropInComponent.delegate = session","dropInComponent.partialPaymentDelegate = session"," ","present(dropInComponent.viewController, animated: true)",""],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Implementing-AdyenSessionDelegate","text":"Implementing `AdyenSessionDelegate`"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenSession","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" makes the necessary calls to handle the whole flow and notifies your application through its delegate, "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenSessionDelegate"},{"type":"text","text":". To handle the results of the Drop-in, the following methods of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenSessionDelegate","isActive":true},{"text":" should be implemented:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["func didComplete(with result: AdyenSessionResult, component: Component, session: AdyenSession)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method will be invoked when the component finishes without any further steps needed by the application. The application just needs to dismiss the current component, ideally after calling "},{"code":"finalizeIfNeeded","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on the component."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"code":["func didFail(with error: Error, from component: Component, session: AdyenSession)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This method is invoked when an error occurred during the use of the Drop-in or the components.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"You can then call the "},{"code":"finalizeIfNeeded","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on 